<description>&lt;p&gt;Ecuador authorities have summoned seven suspects for plotting the murder of a political candidate, while U.S. prosecutors have charged the former president's son and four others with cocaine trafficking, linking local actors to international drug routes. A Polish drug kingpin was arrested in Ecuador for a cross-border cocaine ring and a major Ecuadorian cocaine and weapons trafficking network was busted in New York, showing expanded transnational links. The U.S. military is now assisting Ecuador in its first land operation against cartels, and a magnitude 4.7 earthquake struck off Ecuador with no tsunami warning. The conflict recorded two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOYXhEUmc1OTQzZmZqSU1adTk3UzFDSXBwLXQ0LVJTUkthMlpBQi0yNE40V1hLR0JuNG4wanpOZlIzTlBPMjZlN3lYTkVBbzRyQmVEOVJkcWtvWElJRHJfNE1vanRDcVFnUFlZcjJha0huX2J5clZmZU9HNTdvT2k3VmdWcmZyNHF2MUpSNloyeF9tdUxoOTlqb1pjbW1TSmdVRk1Kbnk5dlBpak96dF9WUGdtcHUtNlpTUnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOUzd0aF8xNFFqVlY5ZVJERHRHbzF1XzlmMTkyYWF6T001MmotY1JxUGtYY1JxVE5NdVQwQjFjbV9UOG53TDZpV3FON25QVnBnc3A2b2lfbzB1aWx4cmN5dnRnS0EyYk9lQmxNb21uVlROT3g4aVF0ZHRhVU4xUEhJMWdET0tscXdTX2kyOGdhZVpEZTBjRDZvVlhJOEhfUXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPWklsSG5RekNlekRfSmVSbDRhNlBnVHhoZUlfQ3JSVF90MDREb2E5S0JGdF9QSGEwRTY5TkxMQm1YSU9wOXBCLU0wZU5xcThLTC1JQkJMOUhuTEducGF2WHVmYlVmNmJFWTI4UWxOQ2x6SGZLTUpOY3B1Y2otZVpyeGs0enVfVUtfcGJHZ1hSVlNQMWlILUJDNzROS3hOTDVDMkxiQ00xb0ExVHE2Rm1VTHoxQlJBNDBkUGJF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Progressive International&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPTlNlczFyOVc4c1dZX0dkQnZUMll1Tk9RVWI1blBpXzhVOWFTeTNTT19BMHly